# ---- GOLDEN FIXTURE (see golden.env / golden.json for the machine-readable manifest) ----
# resetMode=loadvm  |  reset action: QMP 'loadvm golden' (live, no reboot)
# fixture: Magic Cap's Desk room (clock, In/Out message trays, telephone, notepad,
#          datebook, file cabinet, Hallway door) — the exact toggled-off items
#          (screensaver, caret blink, taskbar clock) are the win98se-proven set;
#          the station lead confirms/adjusts these against the real golden.
# golden snapshot 'golden' lives INSIDE the base qcow2 disks (magiccap-c.qcow2 +
# magiccap-d.qcow2), same mechanism as every other qcow2-backed streamhost tile.
# NEVER delete those qcow2s. qemu-streamhost.sh auto '-loadvm golden' when the
# snapshot exists.
# WIN.INI TRAP: autostart is HKLM\...\CurrentVersion\Run "MagicCap" =
# C:\MAGICCAP\MCW.EXE (via C:\MC.REG), never a WIN.INI run= line — see
# qemu-streamhost.sh header and docs/lab/MAGICCAP-WAVE.md for why.
